{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"LDM Calculator"},"description":"Loading metres (LDM) for European road freight \u2014 how much trailer length a pallet load occupies (1 LDM = 1 linear metre of a 2.4 m-wide trailer; a standard artic is 13.6 LDM) \u2014 and whether it fits. Provide a pallet preset OR custom length_mm + width_mm; omitting both errors. fits is true only when the load fits the vehicle's length, its pallet floor positions and, when weight_kg is given, its max payload; without weight_kg the payload is not checked. For the trailer specs behind the presets use vehicle_lookup; for boxes onto one pallet pallet_fitting_calculator; for mixed lines consignment_calculator. Rate-limited: a limit error carries reset_at, the UTC time the allowance resets.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"length_mm":{"description":"Custom pallet length, mm (with width_mm, instead of a preset).","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"pallet":{"description":"Pallet preset (euro 1200x800, uk 1200x1000, half 800x600, quarter 600x400 mm). Provide this OR length_mm + width_mm.","enum":["euro","uk","half","quarter"],"type":"string"},"quantity":{"description":"Number of pallets. Default: 1.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"stack_height":{"description":"Stack height when stackable: 2 or 3. Default: 2.","maximum":3,"minimum":2,"type":"integer"},"stackable":{"description":"Pallets can be stacked (2 or 3 high). Default false.","type":"boolean"},"vehicle":{"description":"Vehicle preset (default artic = 13.6m curtainsider; rigid75 = 7.5t rigid; luton = 3.5t Luton van; us53 / us48 = US trailers; custom needs vehicle_length_m). rigid10 is DEPRECATED (removal in 3.0.0).","enum":["artic","rigid10","rigid75","luton","us53","us48","custom"],"type":"string"},"vehicle_length_m